{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lYwaHpSyqc1793571308.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>塞爾維亞北部，有民眾悼念兩年前火車站石屎簷篷倒塌事故16名死者。</p><p></p><p>在諾維薩德市火車站外空地上，擺放了16個寫有死者姓名的大型紅心。不少民眾周日冒雨帶鮮花等祭品悼念。剛在上周大選中，擊敗前總統武契奇的學生團體手持花牌前往哀悼，並繼續要求問責。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SERB.ANNIVERSARY-0130_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RUI6scF36r1793571306.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>慘劇於2024年11月1日發生，掀起全國反政府示威浪潮，指控當局貪腐及疏忽職守，導致火車站翻新工程不完善，引發悲劇，時任總理武切維奇被迫下台。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SERB.ANNIVERSARY-0130_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026o6ToeQLMlZ1793571303.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>前總統武契奇提前於上月25日舉行議會選舉，根據初步點票，學生團體推動的「學生名單」得票五成三，在議會250個議席中取得140席。武契奇領導的前進黨只取得104席。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:12.834302+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T22:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T05:58:49.568027+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:48.026451+00:00","content_hash":"81ade3e29da727b3d289144833f71174a72f742dbe798f2c1db0bf0544a2bfde","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:12.834302+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}